Each example is a complete analysis of a protocol from its binary.

Structure of each example folder: ([] indicates a directory and @protocol_name is substituted by the actual protocol name)
[@protocol_name]
- [source]
- [binary]
- [disassem]
- [tamarin]
- [squirrel]
- @protocol_name.yaml
- README

[source] and [binary] can be empty if they are not available.

@protocol_name.yaml contains the configuration info needed for building the example.

README contains the step by step instruction to reproduce the example.